 Start mode
⍝ Register the plugin and start the demo app. mode goes straight to EWC.Init:
⍝ 'Browser' for a single user, 'Multi' for several independent users.
⍝     ]link.create ~/dev/ewc/EWC
⍝     ]link.create KendoPlugin ~/dev/ewc-plugins/kendo/APLSource
⍝     ]link.create KendoApp    ~/dev/ewc-plugins/kendo/app
⍝     KendoApp.Start 'Browser'
⍝
⍝ The form itself is built by Initialise, which EWC calls once per browser
⍝ connection. Building it here would serve only the first browser and leave a
⍝ reload showing a blank page.
 EWC←#.EWC
 EWC.PORT←22322

⍝ Before Init here, but after would work equally well - a plugin may register at
⍝ any point in a session.
 #.KendoPlugin.Register

 EWC.Init mode

 ⎕←'Open http://localhost:',(⍕EWC.PORT),'/ - leave this session running'
